WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.107
One document can serve two kinds of reader. Start from the how-to template.

2
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.766
In the source, these lines are marked for administrators only.

3
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:14.153
A general reader's page leaves them out.

4
00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:21.436
An administrator's page keeps them. Same source, two pages, no copy to keep in step.

5
00:00:21.933 --> 00:00:30.906
Publish either page as Markdown, as HTML for a help center, or as DITA, where each step gets its own element.

6
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:36.533
Try it on your own document at karandeshmukh dot dev slash workbench.
